        "text_DiffP6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With multiple users worldwide experiencing deeper sleep, reduced anxiety, and calmer nerves after switching to therapeutic weighted blankets, it’s no surprise that AIWO’s Weighted Blanket is becoming the go-to solution for sleep wellness and stress relief.</p><p>Introducing the AIWO Weighted Blanket — a luxury-grade, scientifically designed sleep enhancer made with 100% bamboo fabric, ultra-soft dual-layer 200 GSM cotton, and 5kg of evenly distributed glass beads. It’s not just a blanket, it’s a natural remedy for insomnia, anxiety, chronic pain, and restlessness, ALL IN ONE!!!</p><p>Crafted with intricate 5 kg glass beads stitching, the AIWO weighted blanket helps regulate heart rate variability, calm the parasympathetic nervous system, and offer world-class comfort for every sleep style and season. It is especially suitable for autistic children and adults with sensory needs.</p>",
            "number_of_lines_shown": "none",
            "read_more_label": "Read more",
