            "title": "Improves Sleep Quality in minimal weeks",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "title_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>By activating the <strong>parasympathetic nervous system</strong>, AIWO weighted blanket helps release <strong>serotonin and melatonin </strong>while minimizing cortisol. This boosts REM cycles and significantly improves <strong>sleep quality, duration, and depth</strong>.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "column_EGT9cJ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "another_icon": "",
            "custom_image": "shopify://shop_images/healthcare.png",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Designed for Heart Rate Variability Balance",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "title_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Weighted pressure helps <strong>balance heart rate variability (HRV)</strong>, a key measure of stress recovery and nervous system health, helping you wake up more refreshed and emotionally balanced.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
